                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-49295",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-49295"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-49295?s=debian&n=libde265&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.20, a crafted H.265 bitstream can cause an out-of-bounds array write in `decoder_context::process_reference_picture_set()` (`libde265/decctx.cc:1376`). The root cause is a missing aggregate bound check on predicted short-term reference picture set entries. Individual list sizes are validated, but the combined count after predicted RPS construction can exceed the 16-entry `PocStFoll` array, writing at index 16. Version 1.0.20 patches the issue.\n\n---\n- libde265 1.1.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140431)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-g2rg-wj66-w594\nFixed by: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/commit/691f3a3c55b3d32478c4a49895dee061a282652 (v1.1.0)\n",
                "markdown": "> libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.0.20, a crafted H.265 bitstream can cause an out-of-bounds array write in `decoder_context::process_reference_picture_set()` (`libde265/decctx.cc:1376`). The root cause is a missing aggregate bound check on predicted short-term reference picture set entries. Individual list sizes are validated, but the combined count after predicted RPS construction can exceed the 16-entry `PocStFoll` array, writing at index 16. Version 1.0.20 patches the issue.\n\n---\n- libde265 1.1.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140431)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-g2rg-wj66-w594\nFixed by: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/commit/691f3a3c55b3d32478c4a49895dee061a282652 (v1.1.0)\n\n|                |                                                                                            |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libde265@1.0.11-1%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                         |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                                  |\n"
              },
