            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-49346",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-49346"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-49346?s=debian&n=libde265&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.1.0, a crafted H.265 bitstream with large SPS dimensions and 16-bit bit depth causes a signed integer overflow in `de265_image_get_buffer()` (`libde265/image.cc:128`). The overflow wraps the plane allocation size to a small value (~1 KB), but the subsequent `fill_image()` call computes the real size using `size_t`, writing ~4 GB into the undersized heap buffer. Version 1.1.0 patches the issue.\n\n---\n- libde265 1.1.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140431)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-vv8h-932h-7r86\nFixed by: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/commit/8a1b5cf212f78e1c77cb46eb5d56e492a9336eb8 (v1.1.0)\n",
                "markdown": "> libde265 is an open source implementation of the h.265 video codec. Prior to version 1.1.0, a crafted H.265 bitstream with large SPS dimensions and 16-bit bit depth causes a signed integer overflow in `de265_image_get_buffer()` (`libde265/image.cc:128`). The overflow wraps the plane allocation size to a small value (~1 KB), but the subsequent `fill_image()` call computes the real size using `size_t`, writing ~4 GB into the undersized heap buffer. Version 1.1.0 patches the issue.\n\n---\n- libde265 1.1.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140431)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libde265/security/advisories/GHSA-vv8h-932h-7r86\nFixed by: https://github.com/strukturag/libde265/commit/8a1b5cf212f78e1c77cb46eb5d56e492a9336eb8 (v1.1.0)\n\n|                |                                                                                            |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libde265@1.0.11-1%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                         |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                                  |\n"
              },
