            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-53467",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-53467"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-53467?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u12",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-51 and 7.1.2-26, the MNG decoder contains a possible heap information disclosure vulnerability because part of the pixels are left unchanged. This issue has been fixed in versions 6.9.13-51 and 7.1.2-26.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-8g53-9m3c-69xg\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/9d1764c43a15b78e18a7f66649989d59079a9e15 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/ad68aca5cd33e199f6cd3048da2ae62e76f05b74 (6.9.13-51)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-51 and 7.1.2-26, the MNG decoder contains a possible heap information disclosure vulnerability because part of the pixels are left unchanged. This issue has been fixed in versions 6.9.13-51 and 7.1.2-26.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-8g53-9m3c-69xg\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/9d1764c43a15b78e18a7f66649989d59079a9e15 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/ad68aca5cd33e199f6cd3048da2ae62e76f05b74 (6.9.13-51)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                 |\n"
