            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-56131",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-56131"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56131?s=debian&n=expat&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libexpat before 2.8.2 lacks handler call depth tracking for calls to XML_ResumeParser from within handlers in cases of a policy violation. Thus, a use-after-free can occur (similar to the CVE-2026-50219 situation).\n\n---\n- expat 2.8.2-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140387)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/1267\n",
                "markdown": "> libexpat before 2.8.2 lacks handler call depth tracking for calls to XML_ResumeParser from within handlers in cases of a policy violation. Thus, a use-after-free can occur (similar to the CVE-2026-50219 situation).\n\n---\n- expat 2.8.2-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1140387)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/1267\n\n|                |                                                                                        |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/expat@2.5.0-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                     |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                              |\n"
              },
