            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-56362",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-56362"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56362?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u8",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a heap-buffer-overflow read vulnerability in GetPixelIndex caused by OpenPixelCache updating image channel metadata before pixel cache memory allocation. Attackers can trigger memory and disk allocation failures to cause a heap-buffer-overflow read affecting any writer calling GetPixelIndex.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <postponed> (Minor issue, fix along in future update)\n[bookworm] - imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8\n[bullseye] - imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.3+deb11u11\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gq5v-qf8q-fp77\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/364606e5cb955b622b13015814e255e1dadd701b (7.1.2-14)\nSee also https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/issues/8567\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6a602fb36f181a0089848344a3b0d79fc6155a2b (6.9.13-41)\nfor imagemagick6 fixed in a jumbo patch\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a heap-buffer-overflow read vulnerability in GetPixelIndex caused by OpenPixelCache updating image channel metadata before pixel cache memory allocation. Attackers can trigger memory and disk allocation failures to cause a heap-buffer-overflow read affecting any writer calling GetPixelIndex.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <postponed> (Minor issue, fix along in future update)\n[bookworm] - imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8\n[bullseye] - imagemagick 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.3+deb11u11\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gq5v-qf8q-fp77\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/364606e5cb955b622b13015814e255e1dadd701b (7.1.2-14)\nSee also https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/issues/8567\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6a602fb36f181a0089848344a3b0d79fc6155a2b (6.9.13-41)\nfor imagemagick6 fixed in a jumbo patch\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8",
                "cvssV3_severity": "UNSPECIFIED",
                "fixed_version": "8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8",
