              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56365?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u12",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-19 contains a memory leak vulnerability in the PNG encoder when writing MNG images. Attackers can trigger the encoder failure condition to exhaust memory resources and cause denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.19+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-x928-4434-crqj\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ca761f220bbf0470e2e7967639bcfb5be305ad28 (7.1.2-19)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/28ed1c9993fe437a44c00bee2ee20d58f7e0204c (6.9.13-44)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-19 contains a memory leak vulnerability in the PNG encoder when writing MNG images. Attackers can trigger the encoder failure condition to exhaust memory resources and cause denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.19+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-x928-4434-crqj\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ca761f220bbf0470e2e7967639bcfb5be305ad28 (7.1.2-19)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/28ed1c9993fe437a44c00bee2ee20d58f7e0204c (6.9.13-44)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                 |\n"
