              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56368?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u12",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a memory leak vulnerability in multiple coders that write raw pixel data where allocated objects are not properly freed. Attackers can trigger this leak by processing specially crafted images, causing memory exhaustion and denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-wfx3-6g53-9fgc\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/fe0a49a58ac5b7a18ff2618b6207dcad71123e43 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/eeab39181be971c1b5871dbb82a3d2a666454772 (6.9.13-39)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a memory leak vulnerability in multiple coders that write raw pixel data where allocated objects are not properly freed. Attackers can trigger this leak by processing specially crafted images, causing memory exhaustion and denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-wfx3-6g53-9fgc\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/fe0a49a58ac5b7a18ff2618b6207dcad71123e43 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/eeab39181be971c1b5871dbb82a3d2a666454772 (6.9.13-39)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                 |\n"
