              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-56373?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u12",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the PDB decoder that uses a stale pointer when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger this vulnerability by processing malicious PDB files to cause crashes or write a single zero byte to freed memory.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-3j4x-rwrx-xxj9\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/168ffe18def968f886c023146a478897866fd621 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/06a0867c1f5076b85577b6b1cf87af901f6d6a84 (6.9.13-39)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-15 contains a use-after-free vulnerability in the PDB decoder that uses a stale pointer when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger this vulnerability by processing malicious PDB files to cause crashes or write a single zero byte to freed memory.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-3j4x-rwrx-xxj9\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/168ffe18def968f886c023146a478897866fd621 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/06a0867c1f5076b85577b6b1cf87af901f6d6a84 (6.9.13-39)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u12                                                                                 |\n"
              },
