            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-61860",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-61860"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-61860?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u13",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.13-51 contains a use-after-free vulnerability that occurs when freetype initialization fails: the method does not exit and continues to use memory that was already freed. This can be triggered during image processing and may lead to a denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-6jwg-7q3p-5fqm\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/3fc646a498eecda9163164046189f90dc677ae64 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/eed471c1286aa27c076348b453b35a2e962967bc (6.9.13-51)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.13-51 contains a use-after-free vulnerability that occurs when freetype initialization fails: the method does not exit and continues to use memory that was already freed. This can be triggered during image processing and may lead to a denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-6jwg-7q3p-5fqm\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/3fc646a498eecda9163164046189f90dc677ae64 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/eed471c1286aa27c076348b453b35a2e962967bc (6.9.13-51)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                 |\n"
