                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 (and 6.x before 6.9.13-51) contains a memory leak in the TIFF encoder that occurs when a temporary file cannot be created, resulting in a small memory leak.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-6vxp-gfwf-hcr9\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/f3ff3afee942a19e3041568bfa740d48213a3dec (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/47cf9792e3be1df42c63125c55870918403d10a8 (6.9.13-52)\nFor imagemagick 6 patch include fix for CVE-2026-61862, CVE-2026-61864, CVE-2026-61865\n",
