              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-61868?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u13",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.x before 6.9.13-51 contains a memory leak in the YUV decoder that occurs when opening of the blob fails. Repeated triggering can lead to resource exhaustion (denial of service).\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-h7f2-f9cc-h2gv\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/808506dc4d0cbf3972ce0d57544a06209b65009c (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/875bd8912b3b54a58e09c14085cf2b14a478a86b (6.9.13-51)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.x before 6.9.13-51 contains a memory leak in the YUV decoder that occurs when opening of the blob fails. Repeated triggering can lead to resource exhaustion (denial of service).\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-h7f2-f9cc-h2gv\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/808506dc4d0cbf3972ce0d57544a06209b65009c (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/875bd8912b3b54a58e09c14085cf2b14a478a86b (6.9.13-51)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                 |\n"
