                "text": "CVE-2026-61870"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-61870?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u13",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 contains a memory leak vulnerability in the VIFF encoder when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger allocation failures by processing specially crafted VIFF images to exhaust available memory and cause denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-m596-67p7-69wh\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/fdbf39ba9a681e53e6025d40501ae5a2bfec3000 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3c574f9ba5387f5f11669fdb4d4e8febc199dca3 (6.9.13-51)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 contains a memory leak vulnerability in the VIFF encoder when memory allocation fails. Attackers can trigger allocation failures by processing specially crafted VIFF images to exhaust available memory and cause denial of service.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-m596-67p7-69wh\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/fdbf39ba9a681e53e6025d40501ae5a2bfec3000 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3c574f9ba5387f5f11669fdb4d4e8febc199dca3 (6.9.13-51)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                 |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13",
