            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-61872",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-61872"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-61872?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u13",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.13-51 contains a memory leak in the TIFF encoder when an invalid tiff:tile-geometry is specified. Supplying malformed tile geometry parameters causes allocated memory not to be released, which can lead to increased memory consumption.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-h5r4-w88w-7ccr\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ed143b98d72bba764b010eb822464f2a12b24ff1 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3f0595f0778201326163253bfdc8bce9a4bbadf6 (6.9.13-51)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick before 7.1.2-26 and 6.9.13-51 contains a memory leak in the TIFF encoder when an invalid tiff:tile-geometry is specified. Supplying malformed tile geometry parameters causes allocated memory not to be released, which can lead to increased memory consumption.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.26+dfsg1-1\n[trixie] - imagemagick <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-h5r4-w88w-7ccr\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ed143b98d72bba764b010eb822464f2a12b24ff1 (7.1.2-26)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3f0595f0778201326163253bfdc8bce9a4bbadf6 (6.9.13-51)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13                                                                                 |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13",
                "cvssV3_severity": "UNSPECIFIED",
                "fixed_version": "8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u13",
