            {
              "id": "CVE-2008-3134",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2008-3134"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2008-3134?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Multiple unspecified vulnerabilities in GraphicsMagick before 1.2.4 allow remote attackers to cause a denial of service (crash, infinite loop, or memory consumption) via (a) unspecified vectors in the (1) AVI, (2) AVS, (3) DCM, (4) EPT, (5) FITS, (6) MTV, (7) PALM, (8) RLA, and (9) TGA decoder readers; and (b) the GetImageCharacteristics function in magick/image.c, as reachable from a crafted (10) PNG, (11) JPEG, (12) BMP, or (13) TIFF file.\n\n---\n- graphicsmagick 1.2.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=491439)\n- imagemagick <unfixed> (unimportant; bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=559775)\nseveral DoS fixed in 1.2.4 according to upstream\nhttp://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=610253\n",
                "markdown": "> Multiple unspecified vulnerabilities in GraphicsMagick before 1.2.4 allow remote attackers to cause a denial of service (crash, infinite loop, or memory consumption) via (a) unspecified vectors in the (1) AVI, (2) AVS, (3) DCM, (4) EPT, (5) FITS, (6) MTV, (7) PALM, (8) RLA, and (9) TGA decoder readers; and (b) the GetImageCharacteristics function in magick/image.c, as reachable from a crafted (10) PNG, (11) JPEG, (12) BMP, or (13) TIFF file.\n\n---\n- graphicsmagick 1.2.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=491439)\n- imagemagick <unfixed> (unimportant; bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=559775)\nseveral DoS fixed in 1.2.4 according to upstream\nhttp://sourceforge.net/project/shownotes.php?release_id=610253\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                                            |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                                                     |\n"
