              "help": {
                "text": "The WritePICONImage function in coders/xpm.c in ImageMagick 7.0.6-4 allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (memory leak) via a crafted file that is mishandled in an AcquireSemaphoreInfo call.\n\n---\n- imagemagick <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/issues/634\nPossibly fixed by same commit as issue #631 upstream\n",
