            {
              "id": "CVE-2017-17740",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2017-17740"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2017-17740?s=debian&n=openldap&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "contrib/slapd-modules/nops/nops.c in OpenLDAP through 2.4.45, when both the nops module and the memberof overlay are enabled, attempts to free a buffer that was allocated on the stack, which allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (slapd crash) via a member MODDN operation.\n\n---\n- openldap <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttp://www.openldap.org/its/index.cgi/Incoming?id=8759\nnops slapd-module not built\n",
                "markdown": "> contrib/slapd-modules/nops/nops.c in OpenLDAP through 2.4.45, when both the nops module and the memberof overlay are enabled, attempts to free a buffer that was allocated on the stack, which allows remote attackers to cause a denial of service (slapd crash) via a member MODDN operation.\n\n---\n- openldap <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttp://www.openldap.org/its/index.cgi/Incoming?id=8759\nnops slapd-module not built\n\n|                |                                                                                         |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/openldap@2.5.13%2Bdfsg-5?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                      |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                               |\n"
