              "help": {
                "text": "cairo through 1.15.14 has an out-of-bounds stack-memory write during processing of a crafted document by WebKitGTK+ because of the interaction between cairo-rectangular-scan-converter.c (the generate and render_rows functions) and cairo-image-compositor.c (the _cairo_image_spans_and_zero function).\n\n---\n- cairo <unfixed> (unimportant; bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=916083)\nhttps://gitlab.freedesktop.org/cairo/cairo/issues/341\nNegligible security impact\n",
