              "help": {
                "text": "stress-test master commit e4c878 was discovered to contain a FPE vulnerability via the component combine_inner at /pixman-combine-float.c.\n\n---\n- pixman <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pixman/pixman/-/issues/76\nCrash in test tool, no security impact\n",
                "markdown": "> stress-test master commit e4c878 was discovered to contain a FPE vulnerability via the component combine_inner at /pixman-combine-float.c.\n\n---\n- pixman <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://gitlab.freedesktop.org/pixman/pixman/-/issues/76\nCrash in test tool, no security impact\n\n|                |                                                                                |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/pixman@0.42.2-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                             |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                      |\n"
