              "help": {
                "text": "libexpat through 2.6.1 allows an XML Entity Expansion attack when there is isolated use of external parsers (created via XML_ExternalEntityParserCreate).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.1-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065868; unimportant)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\n[bullseye] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/842\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/839\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/1d50b80cf31de87750103656f6eb693746854aa8\nTests: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/072eca0b72373da103ce15f8f62d1d7b52695454\nExpat provides API to mitigate expansion attacks, ultimately under control of the app using Expat\nCf. Billion laughs attack assessment for src:expat in CVE-2013-0340.\n",
                "markdown": "> libexpat through 2.6.1 allows an XML Entity Expansion attack when there is isolated use of external parsers (created via XML_ExternalEntityParserCreate).\n\n---\n- expat 2.6.1-2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1065868; unimportant)\n- libxmltok <removed>\n[bookworm] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\n[bullseye] - libxmltok <ignored> (Minor issue, no runtime dependencies left)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/842\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/issues/839\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/1d50b80cf31de87750103656f6eb693746854aa8\nTests: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/072eca0b72373da103ce15f8f62d1d7b52695454\nExpat provides API to mitigate expansion attacks, ultimately under control of the app using Expat\nCf. Billion laughs attack assessment for src:expat in CVE-2013-0340.\n\n|                |                                                                                        |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/expat@2.5.0-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                     |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                              |\n"
