            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-15079",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-15079"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-15079?s=debian&n=curl&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "When doing SSH-based transfers using either SCP or SFTP, and setting the known_hosts file, libcurl could still mistakenly accept connecting to hosts *not present* in the specified file if they were added as recognized in the libssh *global* known_hosts file.\n\n---\n- curl 8.18.0~rc3-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15079.html\nIntroduced with: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/c92d2e14cfb0db662f958effd2ac86f995cf1b5a (curl-7_58_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/adca486c125d9a6d9565b9607a19dce803a8b479 (rc-8_18_0-3, curl-8_18_0)\nDebian builds with libssh2 for SSH backend\n",
                "markdown": "> When doing SSH-based transfers using either SCP or SFTP, and setting the known_hosts file, libcurl could still mistakenly accept connecting to hosts *not present* in the specified file if they were added as recognized in the libssh *global* known_hosts file.\n\n---\n- curl 8.18.0~rc3-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://curl.se/docs/CVE-2025-15079.html\nIntroduced with: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/c92d2e14cfb0db662f958effd2ac86f995cf1b5a (curl-7_58_0)\nFixed by: https://github.com/curl/curl/commit/adca486c125d9a6d9565b9607a19dce803a8b479 (rc-8_18_0-3, curl-8_18_0)\nDebian builds with libssh2 for SSH backend\n\n|                |                                                                                         |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/curl@7.88.1-10%2Bdeb12u8?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                      |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                               |\n"
              },
