              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-15282?s=debian&n=python3.11&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C3.11.2-6%2Bdeb12u7",
              "help": {
                "text": "User-controlled data URLs parsed by urllib.request.DataHandler allow injecting headers through newlines in the data URL mediatype.\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.3-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126779)\n- python3.13 3.13.12-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126780)\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126781)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue)\n- python2.7 <not-affected> (python3 urllib rewritten from old urllib&urllib2; 'data:' URLs are percent-encoded in urllib.URLOpener.open(); 'data:' URLs unsupported in urllib2)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/143925\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/pull/143926\nhttps://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/X66HL7SISGJT33J53OHXMZT4DFLMHVKF/\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/f25509e78e8be6ea73c811ac2b8c928c28841b9f (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/05356b1cc153108aaf27f3b72ce438af4aa218c0 (3.14 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/a35ca3be5842505dab74dc0b90b89cde0405017a (3.13 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/3f396ca9d7bbe2a50ea6b8c9b27c0082884d9f80 (3.11 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/34d76b00dabde81a793bd06dd8ecb057838c4b38 (3.10-branch)\n",
                "markdown": "> User-controlled data URLs parsed by urllib.request.DataHandler allow injecting headers through newlines in the data URL mediatype.\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.3-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126779)\n- python3.13 3.13.12-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126780)\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126781)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue)\n- python2.7 <not-affected> (python3 urllib rewritten from old urllib&urllib2; 'data:' URLs are percent-encoded in urllib.URLOpener.open(); 'data:' URLs unsupported in urllib2)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/143925\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/pull/143926\nhttps://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/X66HL7SISGJT33J53OHXMZT4DFLMHVKF/\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/f25509e78e8be6ea73c811ac2b8c928c28841b9f (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/05356b1cc153108aaf27f3b72ce438af4aa218c0 (3.14 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/a35ca3be5842505dab74dc0b90b89cde0405017a (3.13 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/3f396ca9d7bbe2a50ea6b8c9b27c0082884d9f80 (3.11 branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/34d76b00dabde81a793bd06dd8ecb057838c4b38 (3.10-branch)\n\n|                |                                                                                              |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/python3.11@3.11.2-6%2Bdeb12u5?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <3.11.2-6+deb12u7                                                                  