              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-28164?s=debian&n=libpng1.6&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Buffer Overflow vulnerability in libpng 1.6.43-1.6.46 allows a local attacker to cause a denial of service via png_create_read_struct() function.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.47-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/issues/655\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/pull/657\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/b20e6fb31479868f1d5f5cd268d4776767016941 (v1.6.47)\nNo security impact, memory leak in CLI tool\n",
                "markdown": "> Buffer Overflow vulnerability in libpng 1.6.43-1.6.46 allows a local attacker to cause a denial of service via png_create_read_struct() function.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.47-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/issues/655\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/pull/657\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/b20e6fb31479868f1d5f5cd268d4776767016941 (v1.6.47)\nNo security impact, memory leak in CLI tool\n\n|                |                                                                                   |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libpng1.6@1.6.39-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                         |\n"
