            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-19582",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-19582"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-19582?s=debian&n=binutils&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "In binutils 2.46.1 and prior versions, a victim who opens a crafted PE file using binutils could execute arbitrary code unknowningly via a stack buffer overflow out of bounds write.\n\n---\n- binutils <unfixed> (unimportant)\nbinutils not covered by security support\n",
