            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-32738",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-32738"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-32738?s=debian&n=libheif&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libheif is a HEIF and AVIF file format decoder and encoder. In versions 1.21.2 and below, a crafted 792-byte HEIF sequence file with samples_per_chunk=0 in the stsc box causes an unsigned integer underflow in the Chunk constructor (m_last_sample = 0 + 0 - 1 = UINT32_MAX), mapping all samples to an empty chunk and resulting in a denial of service. When any sample is accessed, the library reads from index 0 of an empty std::vector, causing a guaranteed SEGV (null-page read). The file parses successfully without producing an error; the crash occurs on the first frame access. This issue has been fixed in version 1.22.0.\n\n---\n- libheif 1.23.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1137524)\n[trixie] - libheif <not-affected> (Vulnerable code introduced in 1.20.0)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/security/advisories/GHSA-7f2h-cmpf-v9ww\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/commit/bdaa37728442800497ea224bd232ca25e2f9bdff (v1.22.0)\n",
                "markdown": "> libheif is a HEIF and AVIF file format decoder and encoder. In versions 1.21.2 and below, a crafted 792-byte HEIF sequence file with samples_per_chunk=0 in the stsc box causes an unsigned integer underflow in the Chunk constructor (m_last_sample = 0 + 0 - 1 = UINT32_MAX), mapping all samples to an empty chunk and resulting in a denial of service. When any sample is accessed, the library reads from index 0 of an empty std::vector, causing a guaranteed SEGV (null-page read). The file parses successfully without producing an error; the crash occurs on the first frame access. This issue has been fixed in version 1.22.0.\n\n---\n- libheif 1.23.1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1137524)\n[trixie] - libheif <not-affected> (Vulnerable code introduced in 1.20.0)\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/security/advisories/GHSA-7f2h-cmpf-v9ww\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/commit/bdaa37728442800497ea224bd232ca25e2f9bdff (v1.22.0)\n\n|                |                                                                                           |\n|----------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libheif@1.15.1-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                        |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                                 |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">0",
                "cvssV3_severity": "LOW",
                "fixed_version": "not fixed",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libheif@1.15.1-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.1",
                "tags": [
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
