            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-34191",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-34191"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-34191?s=debian&n=apr-util&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1.6.3-1%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection') vulnerability in Apache Portable Runtime Utility via apr_dbd_oracle provider.  This issue affects Apache Portable Runtime Utility: from 1.6.0 through 1.6.3\n\n---\n- apr-util 1.6.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1143837; unimportant)\n[trixie] - apr-util 1.6.3-3+deb13u1\nhttps://lists.apache.org/thread/8xch90zogywwpo5wnsf4o088mkxy4qtf\nFixed by: https://github.com/apache/apr-util/commit/6ce807e0f12b666c72ffce1a0f21b4df03fa13ec (1.6.4-rc1-candidate)\napr_dbd_oracle provider not built in Debian packages\n",
                "markdown": "> Improper Neutralization of Special Elements used in an SQL Command ('SQL Injection') vulnerability in Apache Portable Runtime Utility via apr_dbd_oracle provider.  This issue affects Apache Portable Runtime Utility: from 1.6.0 through 1.6.3\n\n---\n- apr-util 1.6.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1143837; unimportant)\n[trixie] - apr-util 1.6.3-3+deb13u1\nhttps://lists.apache.org/thread/8xch90zogywwpo5wnsf4o088mkxy4qtf\nFixed by: https://github.com/apache/apr-util/commit/6ce807e0f12b666c72ffce1a0f21b4df03fa13ec (1.6.4-rc1-candidate)\napr_dbd_oracle provider not built in Debian packages\n\n|                |                                                                                 |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/apr-util@1.6.3-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1.6.3-1+deb12u1                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 1.6.3-1+deb12u1                                                                 |\n"
