            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-3441",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-3441"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-3441?s=debian&n=binutils&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in GNU Binutils. This heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability, specifically an out-of-bounds read in the bfd linker, allows an attacker to gain access to sensitive information. By convincing a user to process a specially crafted XCOFF object file, an attacker can trigger this flaw, potentially leading to information disclosure or an application level denial of service.\n\n---\n- binutils <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2443826\nbinutils not covered by security support\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in GNU Binutils. This heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability, specifically an out-of-bounds read in the bfd linker, allows an attacker to gain access to sensitive information. By convincing a user to process a specially crafted XCOFF object file, an attacker can trigger this flaw, potentially leading to information disclosure or an application level denial of service.\n\n---\n- binutils <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2443826\nbinutils not covered by security support\n\n|                |                                                                                |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/binutils@2.40-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                             |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                      |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">0",
                "cvssV3_severity": "LOW",
                "fixed_version": "not fixed",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/binutils@2.40-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "3.1",
                "tags": [
                  "LOW"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-3442",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-3442"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-3442?s=debian&n=binutils&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in GNU Binutils. This vulnerability, a heap-based buffer overflow, specifically an out-of-bounds read, exists in the bfd linker component. An attacker could exploit this by convincing a user to process a specially crafted malicious XCOFF object file. Successful exploitation may lead to the disclosure of sensitive information or cause the application to crash, resulting in an application level denial of service.\n\n---\n- binutils <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2443828\nbinutils not covered by security support\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in GNU Binutils. This vulnerability, a heap-based buffer overflow, specifically an out-of-bounds read, exists in the bfd linker component. An attacker could exploit this by convincing a user to process a specially crafted malicious XCOFF object file. Successful exploitation may lead to the disclosure of sensitive information or cause the application to crash, resulting in an application level denial of service.\n\n---\n- binutils <unfixed> (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2443828\nbinutils not covered by security support\n\n|                |                                                                                |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/binutils@2.40-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                             |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                      |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">0",
                "cvssV3_severity": "LOW",
                "fixed_version": "not fixed",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/binutils@2.40-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
                ],
