            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-52492",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-52492"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-52492?s=debian&n=tiff&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "An integer overflow in the libtiff rgb2ycbcr utility's cvtRaster() function when computing strip buffer sizes can result in an undersized heap allocation and subsequent heap-based buffer overflow during YCbCr conversion of a crafted TIFF image\n\n---\n- tiff <unfixed> (unimportant)\nCrash in CLI tool, no security impact\n",
                "markdown": "> An integer overflow in the libtiff rgb2ycbcr utility's cvtRaster() function when computing strip buffer sizes can result in an undersized heap allocation and subsequent heap-based buffer overflow during YCbCr conversion of a crafted TIFF image\n\n---\n- tiff <unfixed> (unimportant)\nCrash in CLI tool, no security impact\n\n|                |                                                                                       |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/tiff@4.5.0-6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                    |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                             |\n"
