            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-6846",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-6846"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-6846?s=debian&n=binutils&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in binutils. A heap-buffer-overflow vulnerability exists when processing a specially crafted XCOFF (Extended Common Object File Format) object file during linking. A local attacker could trick a user into processing this malicious file, which could lead to arbitrary code execution, allowing the attacker to run unauthorized commands, or cause a denial of service, making the system unavailable.\n\n---\n- binutils 2.47-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2460006\nhttps://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=34049\nhttps://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=7a089e0302382f4d4e077941156e1eaa68d01393 (binutils-2_47)\nbinutils not covered by security support\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in binutils. A heap-buffer-overflow vulnerability exists when processing a specially crafted XCOFF (Extended Common Object File Format) object file during linking. A local attacker could trick a user into processing this malicious file, which could lead to arbitrary code execution, allowing the attacker to run unauthorized commands, or cause a denial of service, making the system unavailable.\n\n---\n- binutils 2.47-1 (unimportant)\nhttps://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2460006\nhttps://sourceware.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=34049\nhttps://sourceware.org/git/gitweb.cgi?p=binutils-gdb.git;h=7a089e0302382f4d4e077941156e1eaa68d01393 (binutils-2_47)\nbinutils not covered by security support\n\n|                |                                                                                |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/binutils@2.40-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                             |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                      |\n"
              },
