              "help": {
                "text": "If the value passed to os.path.expandvars() is user-controlled a  performance degradation is possible when expanding environment  variables.\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.2-1\n- python3.13 3.13.11-1\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126777)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue, DoS)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/136065\nhttps://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/IUP5QJ6D4KK6ULHOMPC7DPNKRYQTQNLA/\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/f029e8db626ddc6e3a3beea4eff511a71aaceb5c (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/631ba3407e3348ccd56ce5160c4fb2c5dc5f4d84 (v3.14.1)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9ab89c026aa9611c4b0b67c288b8303a480fe742 (v3.13.10)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/5dceb93486176e6b4a6d9754491005113eb23427 (v3.11.15)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/892747b4cf0f95ba8beb51c0d0658bfaa381ebca (3.10-branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/2e6150adccaaf5bd95d4c19dfd04a36e0b325d8c (v3.9.25)\n",
                "markdown": "> If the value passed to os.path.expandvars() is user-controlled a  performance degradation is possible when expanding environment  variables.\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.2-1\n- python3.13 3.13.11-1\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126777)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue, DoS)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/136065\nhttps://mail.python.org/archives/list/security-announce@python.org/thread/IUP5QJ6D4KK6ULHOMPC7DPNKRYQTQNLA/\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/f029e8db626ddc6e3a3beea4eff511a71aaceb5c (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/631ba3407e3348ccd56ce5160c4fb2c5dc5f4d84 (v3.14.1)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/9ab89c026aa9611c4b0b67c288b8303a480fe742 (v3.13.10)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/5dceb93486176e6b4a6d9754491005113eb23427 (v3.11.15)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/892747b4cf0f95ba8beb51c0d0658bfaa381ebca (3.10-branch)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/2e6150adccaaf5bd95d4c19dfd04a36e0b325d8c (v3.9.25)\n\n|                |                                                                                              |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/python3.11@3.11.2-6%2Bdeb12u5?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <3.11.2-6+deb12u7                                                                            |\n| Fixed version  | 3.11.2-6+deb12u7                                                                             |\n"
