              "help": {
                "text": "When loading a plist file, the plistlib module reads data in size specified by the file itself, meaning a malicious file can cause OOM and DoS issues\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.2-1\n- python3.13 3.13.11-1\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126782)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/119342\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/pull/119343\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/694922cf40aa3a28f898b5f5ee08b71b4922df70 (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/b64441e4852383645af5b435411a6f849dd1b4cb (v3.14.1)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/71fa8eb8233b37f16c88b6e3e583b461b205d1ba (v3.13.10)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/cefee7d118a26ef6cd43db59bb9d98ca9a331111 (v3.11.15)\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/065266450ea5519a43bcc199e48d304f1e7038e8 (v3.4.2rc1)\n",
                "markdown": "> When loading a plist file, the plistlib module reads data in size specified by the file itself, meaning a malicious file can cause OOM and DoS issues\n\n---\n- python3.14 3.14.2-1\n- python3.13 3.13.11-1\n[trixie] - python3.13 3.13.5-2+deb13u1\n- python3.11 <removed>\n[bookworm] - python3.11 3.11.2-6+deb12u7\n- python3.9 <removed>\n- pypy3 7.3.21+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126782)\n[trixie] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bookworm] - pypy3 <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\n[bullseye] - pypy3 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/issues/119342\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/pull/119343\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/694922cf40aa3a28f898b5f5ee08b71b4922df70 (main)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/b64441e4852383645af5b435411a6f849dd1b4cb (v3.14.1)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/71fa8eb8233b37f16c88b6e3e583b461b205d1ba (v3.13.10)\nhttps://github.com/python/cpython/commit/cefee7d118a26ef6cd43db59bb9d98ca9a331111 (v3.11.15)\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/python/cpython/commit/065266450ea5519a43bcc199e48d304f1e7038e8 (v3.4.2rc1)\n\n|                |                                                                                              |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/python3.11@3.11.2-6%2Bdeb12u5?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <3.11.2-6+deb12u7                                                                            |\n| Fixed version  | 3.11.2-6+deb12u7                                                                             |\n"
