              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-35387?s=debian&n=openssh&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1%3A9.2p1-2%2Bdeb12u10",
              "help": {
                "text": "OpenSSH before 10.3 can use unintended ECDSA algorithms. Listing of any ECDSA algorithm in PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms or HostbasedAcceptedAlgorithms is misinterpreted to mean all ECDSA algorithms.\n\n---\n- openssh 1:10.3p1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132574)\n[trixie] - openssh 1:10.0p1-7+deb13u3\n[bookworm] - openssh 1:9.2p1-2+deb12u10\nhttps://www.openssh.org/releasenotes.html#10.3p1\n",
                "markdown": "> OpenSSH before 10.3 can use unintended ECDSA algorithms. Listing of any ECDSA algorithm in PubkeyAcceptedAlgorithms or HostbasedAcceptedAlgorithms is misinterpreted to mean all ECDSA algorithms.\n\n---\n- openssh 1:10.3p1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132574)\n[trixie] - openssh 1:10.0p1-7+deb13u3\n[bookworm] - openssh 1:9.2p1-2+deb12u10\nhttps://www.openssh.org/releasenotes.html#10.3p1\n\n|                |                                                                                              |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/openssh@1%3A9.2p1-2%2Bdeb12u5?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1:9.2p1-2+deb12u10                                                                          |\n| Fixed version  | 1:9.2p1-2+deb12u10                                                                           |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
