              "help": {
                "text": "In libexif through 0.6.25, an unsigned 32bit integer overflow in Nikon MakerNote handling could be used by local attackers to cause crashes or information leaks. This only affects 32bit systems.\n\n---\n- libexif 0.6.26-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1133922)\n[trixie] - libexif 0.6.25-1+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - libexif 0.6.24-1+deb12u1\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexif/libexif/commit/93003b93e50b3d259bd2227d8775b73a53c35d58\n",
                "markdown": "> In libexif through 0.6.25, an unsigned 32bit integer overflow in Nikon MakerNote handling could be used by local attackers to cause crashes or information leaks. This only affects 32bit systems.\n\n---\n- libexif 0.6.26-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1133922)\n[trixie] - libexif 0.6.25-1+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - libexif 0.6.24-1+deb12u1\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexif/libexif/commit/93003b93e50b3d259bd2227d8775b73a53c35d58\n\n|                |                                                                                 |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libexif@0.6.24-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <0.6.24-1+deb12u1                                                               |\n| Fixed version  | 0.6.24-1+deb12u1                                                                |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
