            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-41254",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-41254"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-41254?s=debian&n=lcms2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C2.14-2%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Little CMS (lcms2) through 2.18 has an integer overflow in CubeSize in cmslut.c because the overflow check is performed after the multiplication.\n\n---\n- lcms2 2.17-1.1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1134335)\n- openjdk-26 26.0.2+10-1\n- openjdk-25 25.0.4+7-1\n- openjdk-21 21.0.12+8-1\n- openjdk-17 17.0.20+8-1\n- openjdk-11 11.0.32+9-1\n- openjdk-8 8u502-ga-1\nhttps://openjdk.org/groups/vulnerability/advisories/2026-07-21\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/17/16\nhttps://abhinavagarwal07.github.io/posts/lcms2-cubesize-overflow/\nFixed by: https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/commit/da6110b1d14abc394633a388209abd5ebedd7ab0 (master)\nFixed by: https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/commit/e0641b1828d0a1af5ecb1b11fe22f24fceefd4bc (master)\n",
                "markdown": "> Little CMS (lcms2) through 2.18 has an integer overflow in CubeSize in cmslut.c because the overflow check is performed after the multiplication.\n\n---\n- lcms2 2.17-1.1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1134335)\n- openjdk-26 26.0.2+10-1\n- openjdk-25 25.0.4+7-1\n- openjdk-21 21.0.12+8-1\n- openjdk-17 17.0.20+8-1\n- openjdk-11 11.0.32+9-1\n- openjdk-8 8u502-ga-1\nhttps://openjdk.org/groups/vulnerability/advisories/2026-07-21\nhttps://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/04/17/16\nhttps://abhinavagarwal07.github.io/posts/lcms2-cubesize-overflow/\nFixed by: https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/commit/da6110b1d14abc394633a388209abd5ebedd7ab0 (master)\nFixed by: https://github.com/mm2/Little-CMS/commit/e0641b1828d0a1af5ecb1b11fe22f24fceefd4bc (master)\n\n|                |                                                                             |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/lcms2@2.14-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <2.14-2+deb12u1                                                             |\n| Fixed version  | 2.14-2+deb12u1                                                              |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
