              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-46692?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u10",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-48 and 7.1.2-23, an attacker who can connect to a magick -distribute-cache service can cause a heap buffer over-write in the server process. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-48 and 7.1.2-23.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-p93h-f2jc-477j\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/75bcc76eac8b26ce0d6900117c9b308b0aed5719 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6efd2e9277e6e6f5a8171d6c67bc93f1ff1f3eb8 (6.9.13-48)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-48 and 7.1.2-23, an attacker who can connect to a magick -distribute-cache service can cause a heap buffer over-write in the server process. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-48 and 7.1.2-23.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-p93h-f2jc-477j\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/75bcc76eac8b26ce0d6900117c9b308b0aed5719 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6efd2e9277e6e6f5a8171d6c67bc93f1ff1f3eb8 (6.9.13-48)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                 |\n"
