                "text": "CVE-2026-53463"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-53463?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u11",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25, when passing incorrect arguments in the distort operation a null pointer deference will occur. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.25+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-p9rq-q46c-g4x6\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/aa288f3023da9ad9e0d85563d76ea7e1cb58abed (7.1.2-25)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3492c2ef45160d0fdfe34724fa6bce07583d3ec1 (6.9.13-50)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25, when passing incorrect arguments in the distort operation a null pointer deference will occur. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-50 and 7.1.2-25.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.25+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-p9rq-q46c-g4x6\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/aa288f3023da9ad9e0d85563d76ea7e1cb58abed (7.1.2-25)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/3492c2ef45160d0fdfe34724fa6bce07583d3ec1 (6.9.13-50)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u11                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u11                                                                                 |\n"
              },
