            {
              "id": "CVE-2023-52969",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2023-52969"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2023-52969?s=debian&n=mariadb&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1%3A10.11.13-0%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "MariaDB Server 10.4 through 10.5.*, 10.6 through 10.6.*, 10.7 through 10.11.*, and 11.0 through 11.0.* can sometimes crash with an empty backtrace log. This may be related to make_aggr_tables_info and optimize_stage2.\n\n---\n- mariadb 1:11.8.2-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1100437)\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.13-0+deb12u1\n- mariadb-10.5 <removed>\nhttps://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-32083\nFixed in MariaDB: 10.5.29, 10.6.22, 10.11.12, 11.4.6, 11.8.2\nFixed by fix of MDEV-32086/CVE-2023-52970\n",
                "markdown": "> MariaDB Server 10.4 through 10.5.*, 10.6 through 10.6.*, 10.7 through 10.11.*, and 11.0 through 11.0.* can sometimes crash with an empty backtrace log. This may be related to make_aggr_tables_info and optimize_stage2.\n\n---\n- mariadb 1:11.8.2-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1100437)\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.13-0+deb12u1\n- mariadb-10.5 <removed>\nhttps://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-32083\nFixed in MariaDB: 10.5.29, 10.6.22, 10.11.12, 11.4.6, 11.8.2\nFixed by fix of MDEV-32086/CVE-2023-52970\n\n|                |                                                                                                |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/mariadb@1%3A10.11.6-0%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1:10.11.13-0+deb12u1                                                                          |\n| Fixed version  | 1:10.11.13-0+deb12u1                                                                           |\n"
