              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-45624?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u10",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-47 and 7.1.2-22, when performing a polynomial distortion an out of bounds over-read of 24 bytes can occur when specifying specific arguments. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-47 and 7.1.2-22.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-pfvh-m9xv-8966\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/a66ab7bc559f041b1434606496b5b4b0906ff9a2 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/7736b7c458d0c694e26023ad4bd3436fc2f951ff (6.9.13-48)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 6.9.13-47 and 7.1.2-22, when performing a polynomial distortion an out of bounds over-read of 24 bytes can occur when specifying specific arguments. This issue has been patched in versions 6.9.13-47 and 7.1.2-22.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-pfvh-m9xv-8966\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/a66ab7bc559f041b1434606496b5b4b0906ff9a2 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/7736b7c458d0c694e26023ad4bd3436fc2f951ff (6.9.13-48)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                 |\n"
