            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-2361",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-2361"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-2361?s=debian&n=mercurial&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C6.3.2-1%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A vulnerability was found in Mercurial SCM 4.5.3/71.19.145.211. It has been declared as problematic. This vulnerability affects unknown code of the component Web Interface. The manipulation of the argument cmd leads to cross site scripting. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.\n\n---\n- mercurial 6.9.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1100899)\nhttps://lists.mercurial-scm.org/pipermail/mercurial-packaging/2025-March/000754.html\nFixed by: https://foss.heptapod.net/mercurial/mercurial-devel/-/commit/a5c72ed2929341d97b11968211c880854803f003 (6.9.4)\n",
                "markdown": "> A vulnerability was found in Mercurial SCM 4.5.3/71.19.145.211. It has been declared as problematic. This vulnerability affects unknown code of the component Web Interface. The manipulation of the argument cmd leads to cross site scripting. The attack can be initiated remotely. The exploit has been disclosed to the public and may be used. The vendor was contacted early about this disclosure but did not respond in any way.\n\n---\n- mercurial 6.9.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1100899)\nhttps://lists.mercurial-scm.org/pipermail/mercurial-packaging/2025-March/000754.html\nFixed by: https://foss.heptapod.net/mercurial/mercurial-devel/-/commit/a5c72ed2929341d97b11968211c880854803f003 (6.9.4)\n\n|                |                                                                                  |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/mercurial@6.3.2-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <6.3.2-1+deb12u1                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 6.3.2-1+deb12u1                                                                  |\n"
