            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-25638",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-25638"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-25638?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u7",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, memory leak exists in `coders/msl.c`. In the `WriteMSLImage` function of the `msl.c` file, resources are allocated. But the function returns early without releasing these allocated resources. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gxcx-qjqp-8vjw\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/1e88fca11c7b8517100d518bc99bd8c474f02f88 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/c5b4a1c6ff347f66346cbec499f3e881da21faf3 (6.9.13-39)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, memory leak exists in `coders/msl.c`. In the `WriteMSLImage` function of the `msl.c` file, resources are allocated. But the function returns early without releasing these allocated resources. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gxcx-qjqp-8vjw\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/1e88fca11c7b8517100d518bc99bd8c474f02f88 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/c5b4a1c6ff347f66346cbec499f3e881da21faf3 (6.9.13-39)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7",
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "fixed_version": "8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
