            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-25986",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-25986"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-25986?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u7",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, a heap buffer overflow write vulnerability exists in ReadYUVImage() (coders/yuv.c) when processing malicious YUV 4:2:2 (NoInterlace) images. The pixel-pair loop writes one pixel beyond the allocated row buffer. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-mqfc-82jx-3mr2\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/b9c80ad3ca802b6883da25f153c4fdf72c017eba (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/99340686966580c06a1599e247dc41fb59a430c8 (6.9.13-39)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, a heap buffer overflow write vulnerability exists in ReadYUVImage() (coders/yuv.c) when processing malicious YUV 4:2:2 (NoInterlace) images. The pixel-pair loop writes one pixel beyond the allocated row buffer. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-mqfc-82jx-3mr2\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/b9c80ad3ca802b6883da25f153c4fdf72c017eba (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/99340686966580c06a1599e247dc41fb59a430c8 (6.9.13-39)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
