            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-32636",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-32636"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-32636?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u8",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to 7.1.2-17 and 6.9.13-42, the NewXMLTree method contains a bug that could result in a crash due to an out of write bounds of a single zero byte. Versions 7.1.2-17 and 6.9.13-42 fix the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.18+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gc62-2v5p-qpmp\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/361b42c91d173cfb4bd8f39898c599feef6a1e55 (7.1.2-17)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/a04a9a514c70c9533ccb9f6ff80102a1b9a6445b (6.9.13-42)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to 7.1.2-17 and 6.9.13-42, the NewXMLTree method contains a bug that could result in a crash due to an out of write bounds of a single zero byte. Versions 7.1.2-17 and 6.9.13-42 fix the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.18+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-gc62-2v5p-qpmp\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/361b42c91d173cfb4bd8f39898c599feef6a1e55 (7.1.2-17)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/a04a9a514c70c9533ccb9f6ff80102a1b9a6445b (6.9.13-42)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                  |\n"
              },
