              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-3494?s=debian&n=mariadb&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1%3A10.11.18-0%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "In MariaDB server version through 11.8.5, when server audit plugin is enabled with server_audit_events variable configured with QUERY_DCL, QUERY_DDL, or QUERY_DML filtering, if an authenticated database user invokes a SQL statement prefixed with double-hyphen (—) or hash (#) style comments, the statement is not logged.\n\n---\n- mariadb 1:11.8.6-1\n[trixie] - mariadb 1:11.8.6-0+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1\nhttps://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/635559a2ad68a5a6d1a354e8209c58323dba0261\nFixed in MariaDB: 12.3.1, 12.2.2, 11.8.6, 11.4.10, 10.11.16, 10.6.25\n",
                "markdown": "> In MariaDB server version through 11.8.5, when server audit plugin is enabled with server_audit_events variable configured with QUERY_DCL, QUERY_DDL, or QUERY_DML filtering, if an authenticated database user invokes a SQL statement prefixed with double-hyphen (—) or hash (#) style comments, the statement is not logged.\n\n---\n- mariadb 1:11.8.6-1\n[trixie] - mariadb 1:11.8.6-0+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1\nhttps://github.com/MariaDB/server/commit/635559a2ad68a5a6d1a354e8209c58323dba0261\nFixed in MariaDB: 12.3.1, 12.2.2, 11.8.6, 11.4.10, 10.11.16, 10.6.25\n\n|                |                                                                                                |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/mariadb@1%3A10.11.6-0%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1                                                                          |\n| Fixed version  | 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1                                                                           |\n"
