            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-15059",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-15059"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-15059?s=debian&n=systemd&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Local unprivileged users can terminate arbitrary local processes via a systemd-oomd IPC API due to a missing path traversal validation.\n\n---\n- systemd 261~rc3-1\n[trixie] - systemd <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/systemd/systemd/security/advisories/GHSA-652q-wxr6-h5j6\nFixed by: https://github.com/systemd/systemd/commit/cde88c4ea364e816619f385a870d074ebc12fe0f (v261-rc3)\nFixed by: https://github.com/systemd/systemd/commit/a8feb2f23565d39df5c90a753c851c1934a53117 (v258.9)\n",
