                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-23874",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-23874"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-23874?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u6",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Versions prior to 7.1.2-13 have a stack overflow via infinite recursion in MSL (Magick Scripting Language) `<write>` command when writing to MSL format. Version 7.1.2-13 fixes the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.13+dfsg1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126075)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-9vj4-wc7r-p844\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/2a09644b10a5b146e0a7c63b778bd74a112ebec3 (7.1.2-13)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/fe2970bbbe02c6fe875cc2b269390a3165d57706 (6.9.13-38)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Versions prior to 7.1.2-13 have a stack overflow via infinite recursion in MSL (Magick Scripting Language) `<write>` command when writing to MSL format. Version 7.1.2-13 fixes the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.13+dfsg1-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126075)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-9vj4-wc7r-p844\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/2a09644b10a5b146e0a7c63b778bd74a112ebec3 (7.1.2-13)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/fe2970bbbe02c6fe875cc2b269390a3165d57706 (6.9.13-38)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u6                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u6                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u6",
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "fixed_version": "8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u6",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "5.5",
