            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-32414",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-32414"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-32414?s=debian&n=libxml2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C2.9.14%2Bdfsg-1.3%7Edeb12u2",
              "help": {
                "text": "In libxml2 before 2.13.8 and 2.14.x before 2.14.2, out-of-bounds memory access can occur in the Python API (Python bindings) because of an incorrect return value. This occurs in xmlPythonFileRead and xmlPythonFileReadRaw because of a difference between bytes and characters.\n\n---\n- libxml2 2.12.7+dfsg+really2.9.14-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1102521)\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/issues/889\n",
                "markdown": "> In libxml2 before 2.13.8 and 2.14.x before 2.14.2, out-of-bounds memory access can occur in the Python API (Python bindings) because of an incorrect return value. This occurs in xmlPythonFileRead and xmlPythonFileReadRaw because of a difference between bytes and characters.\n\n---\n- libxml2 2.12.7+dfsg+really2.9.14-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1102521)\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/issues/889\n\n|                |                                                                                                  |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libxml2@2.9.14%2Bdfsg-1.3~deb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <2.9.14+dfsg-1.3~deb12u2                                                                         |\n| Fixed version  | 2.9.14+dfsg-1.3~deb12u2                                                                          |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<2.9.14+dfsg-1.3~deb12u2",
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "fixed_version": "2.9.14+dfsg-1.3~deb12u2",
                "purls": [
