            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-22695",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-22695"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-22695?s=debian&n=libpng1.6&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1.6.39-2%2Bdeb12u2",
              "help": {
                "text": "LIBPNG is a reference library for use in applications that read, create, and manipulate PNG (Portable Network Graphics) raster image files. From 1.6.51 to 1.6.53, there is a heap buffer over-read in the libpng simplified API function png_image_finish_read when processing interlaced 16-bit PNGs with 8-bit output format and non-minimal row stride. This is a regression introduced by the fix for CVE-2025-65018. This vulnerability is fixed in 1.6.54.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.54-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1125443)\n[trixie] - libpng1.6 1.6.48-1+deb13u2\n[bookworm] - libpng1.6 1.6.39-2+deb12u2\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/security/advisories/GHSA-mmq5-27w3-rxpp\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/218612ddd6b17944e21eda56caf8b4bf7779d1ea (v1.6.51)\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/e4f7ad4ea2a471776c81dda4846b7691925d9786\nIntroducing fix for CVE-2025-65018 got backported into older suites\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/issues/778\n",
                "markdown": "> LIBPNG is a reference library for use in applications that read, create, and manipulate PNG (Portable Network Graphics) raster image files. From 1.6.51 to 1.6.53, there is a heap buffer over-read in the libpng simplified API function png_image_finish_read when processing interlaced 16-bit PNGs with 8-bit output format and non-minimal row stride. This is a regression introduced by the fix for CVE-2025-65018. This vulnerability is fixed in 1.6.54.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.54-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1125443)\n[trixie] - libpng1.6 1.6.48-1+deb13u2\n[bookworm] - libpng1.6 1.6.39-2+deb12u2\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/security/advisories/GHSA-mmq5-27w3-rxpp\nIntroduced by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/218612ddd6b17944e21eda56caf8b4bf7779d1ea (v1.6.51)\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/e4f7ad4ea2a471776c81dda4846b7691925d9786\nIntroducing fix for CVE-2025-65018 got backported into older suites\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/issues/778\n\n|                |                                                                                   |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libpng1.6@1.6.39-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1.6.39-2+deb12u2                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 1.6.39-2+deb12u2                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.6.39-2+deb12u2",
                "cvssV3_severity": "MEDIUM",
                "fixed_version": "1.6.39-2+deb12u2",
                "purls": [
                  "pkg:deb/debian/libpng1.6@1.6.39-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12"
                ],
                "security-severity": "6.1",
