                "text": "CVE-2026-26066"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-26066?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u7",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, a crafted profile contain invalid IPTC data may cause an infinite loop when writing it with `IPTCTEXT`. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-v994-63cg-9wj3\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/880057ce34f6da9dff2fe3b290bbbc45b743e613 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/c20c915e2fea200b6210b4759a6f83bba077ed78 (6.9.13-39)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40, a crafted profile contain invalid IPTC data may cause an infinite loop when writing it with `IPTCTEXT`. Versions 7.1.2-15 and 6.9.13-40 contain a patch.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.15+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-v994-63cg-9wj3\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/880057ce34f6da9dff2fe3b290bbbc45b743e613 (7.1.2-14)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/c20c915e2fea200b6210b4759a6f83bba077ed78 (6.9.13-39)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u7                                                                                  |\n"
