            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-46523",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-46523"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-46523?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u10",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2.23 and 6.9.13-48, a crafted MSL image can trigger a heap-use-after-free. Versions 7.1.2.23 and 6.9.13-48 fix the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-5r4x-w6p5-222q\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/4d92249c84536a20e9723376ec016b4950dcb454 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/5ad5fdcc45871bdeeca414a883acb880532accce (6.9.13-48)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2.23 and 6.9.13-48, a crafted MSL image can trigger a heap-use-after-free. Versions 7.1.2.23 and 6.9.13-48 fix the issue.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.23+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-5r4x-w6p5-222q\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/4d92249c84536a20e9723376ec016b4950dcb454 (7.1.2-23)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/5ad5fdcc45871bdeeca414a883acb880532accce (6.9.13-48)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u10                                                                                 |\n"
