              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2021-46312?s=debian&n=djvulibre&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C3.5.28-2.2%7Edeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "An issue was discovered IW44EncodeCodec.cpp in djvulibre 3.5.28 in allows attackers to cause a denial of service via divide by zero.\n\n---\n- djvulibre 3.5.28-2.2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1052669)\n[bookworm] - djvulibre 3.5.28-2.2~deb12u1\n[buster] - djvulibre <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://sourceforge.net/p/djvu/bugs/344/\nFixed by: (only IW44EncodeCodec.cpp changes): https://sourceforge.net/p/djvu/djvulibre-git/ci/05d00e831a5c55af2d407a513a9157a03449dc2c/\n",
                "markdown": "> An issue was discovered IW44EncodeCodec.cpp in djvulibre 3.5.28 in allows attackers to cause a denial of service via divide by zero.\n\n---\n- djvulibre 3.5.28-2.2 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1052669)\n[bookworm] - djvulibre 3.5.28-2.2~deb12u1\n[buster] - djvulibre <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://sourceforge.net/p/djvu/bugs/344/\nFixed by: (only IW44EncodeCodec.cpp changes): https://sourceforge.net/p/djvu/djvulibre-git/ci/05d00e831a5c55af2d407a513a9157a03449dc2c/\n\n|                |                                                                                   |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/djvulibre@3.5.28-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <3.5.28-2.2~deb12u1                                                               |\n| Fixed version  | 3.5.28-2.2~deb12u1                                                                |\n"
