                ],
                "security-severity": "6.5",
                "tags": [
                  "MEDIUM"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-50952",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-50952"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-50952?s=debian&n=openjpeg2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C2.5.0-2%2Bdeb12u2",
              "help": {
                "text": "openjpeg v 2.5.0 was discovered to contain a NULL pointer dereference via the component /openjp2/dwt.c.\n\n---\n- openjpeg2 2.5.3-1\n[bookworm] - openjpeg2 2.5.0-2+deb12u2\nhttps://github.com/uclouvain/openjpeg/issues/1505\nFixed by: https://github.com/uclouvain/openjpeg/commit/d903fbb4ab9ccf9b96c8bc7398fafc0007505a37 (v2.5.1)\n",
                "markdown": "> openjpeg v 2.5.0 was discovered to contain a NULL pointer dereference via the component /openjp2/dwt.c.\n\n---\n- openjpeg2 2.5.3-1\n[bookworm] - openjpeg2 2.5.0-2+deb12u2\nhttps://github.com/uclouvain/openjpeg/issues/1505\nFixed by: https://github.com/uclouvain/openjpeg/commit/d903fbb4ab9ccf9b96c8bc7398fafc0007505a37 (v2.5.1)\n\n|                |                                                                                            |\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/openjpeg2@2.5.0-2%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <2.5.0-2+deb12u2                                                                           |\n| Fixed version  | 2.5.0-2+deb12u2                                                                            |\n"
