            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-21968",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-21968"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-21968?s=debian&n=mariadb&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1%3A10.11.18-0%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Vulnerability in the MySQL Server product of Oracle MySQL (component: Server: Optimizer).  Supported versions that are affected are 8.0.0-8.0.44, 8.4.0-8.4.7 and  9.0.0-9.5.0. Easily exploitable vulnerability allows low privileged attacker with network access via multiple protocols to compromise MySQL Server.  Successful attacks of this vulnerability can result in unauthorized ability to cause a hang or frequently repeatable crash (complete DOS) of MySQL Server. CVSS 3.1 Base Score 6.5 (Availability impacts).  CVSS Vector: (CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H).\n\n---\n- mysql-8.0 8.0.45-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126115)\n- mariadb 1:11.8.5-1\n[trixie] - mariadb 11.8.6-0+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1\n",
                "markdown": "> Vulnerability in the MySQL Server product of Oracle MySQL (component: Server: Optimizer).  Supported versions that are affected are 8.0.0-8.0.44, 8.4.0-8.4.7 and  9.0.0-9.5.0. Easily exploitable vulnerability allows low privileged attacker with network access via multiple protocols to compromise MySQL Server.  Successful attacks of this vulnerability can result in unauthorized ability to cause a hang or frequently repeatable crash (complete DOS) of MySQL Server. CVSS 3.1 Base Score 6.5 (Availability impacts).  CVSS Vector: (CVSS:3.1/AV:N/AC:L/PR:L/UI:N/S:U/C:N/I:N/A:H).\n\n---\n- mysql-8.0 8.0.45-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1126115)\n- mariadb 1:11.8.5-1\n[trixie] - mariadb 11.8.6-0+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - mariadb 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1\n\n|                |                                                                                                |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/mariadb@1%3A10.11.6-0%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1                                                                          |\n| Fixed version  | 1:10.11.18-0+deb12u1                                                                           |\n"
