            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-30937",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-30937"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-30937?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u8",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41, a 32-bit unsigned integer overflow in the XWD (X Windows) encoder can cause an undersized heap buffer allocation. When writing a extremely large image an out of bounds heap write can occur. This vulnerability is fixed in 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.16+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-qpg4-j99f-8xcg\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/134f1c17d5dafc565182f9b00304fc08cfa3184e (7.1.2-16)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/42e5a37eeb60ca4fdede5060c0aa60802c2dc701 (6.9.13-41)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41, a 32-bit unsigned integer overflow in the XWD (X Windows) encoder can cause an undersized heap buffer allocation. When writing a extremely large image an out of bounds heap write can occur. This vulnerability is fixed in 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.16+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-qpg4-j99f-8xcg\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/134f1c17d5dafc565182f9b00304fc08cfa3184e (7.1.2-16)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/42e5a37eeb60ca4fdede5060c0aa60802c2dc701 (6.9.13-41)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                  |\n"
              },
