            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-28690",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-28690"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-28690?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u8",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41, a stack buffer overflow vulnerability exists in the MNG encoder. There is a bounds checks missing that could corrupting the stack with attacker-controlled data. This vulnerability is fixed in 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.16+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-7h7q-j33q-hvpf\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/e6e874875e48dd9838acca3bd22c14a4d2f1b3ca (7.1.2-16)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6a602fb36f181a0089848344a3b0d79fc6155a2b (6.9.13-41) (jumbo security patch for multiple issues)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. Prior to versions 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41, a stack buffer overflow vulnerability exists in the MNG encoder. There is a bounds checks missing that could corrupting the stack with attacker-controlled data. This vulnerability is fixed in 7.1.2-16 and 6.9.13-41.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.16+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-7h7q-j33q-hvpf\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/e6e874875e48dd9838acca3bd22c14a4d2f1b3ca (7.1.2-16)\nFixed by: https://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/6a602fb36f181a0089848344a3b0d79fc6155a2b (6.9.13-41) (jumbo security patch for multiple issues)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u8                                                                                  |\n"
