            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-5222",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-5222"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-5222?s=debian&n=icu&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C72.1-3%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A stack buffer overflow was found in Internationl components for unicode (ICU ). While running the genrb binary, the 'subtag' struct overflowed at the SRBRoot::addTag function. This issue may lead to memory corruption and local arbitrary code execution.\n\n---\n- icu 76.1-4 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1106684)\nhttps://unicode-org.atlassian.net/browse/ICU-22957\nFixed by: https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/commit/2c667e31cfd0b6bb1923627a932fd3453a5bac77 (release-77-rc)\n",
                "markdown": "> A stack buffer overflow was found in Internationl components for unicode (ICU ). While running the genrb binary, the 'subtag' struct overflowed at the SRBRoot::addTag function. This issue may lead to memory corruption and local arbitrary code execution.\n\n---\n- icu 76.1-4 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1106684)\nhttps://unicode-org.atlassian.net/browse/ICU-22957\nFixed by: https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/commit/2c667e31cfd0b6bb1923627a932fd3453a5bac77 (release-77-rc)\n\n|                |                                                                           |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/icu@72.1-3?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <72.1-3+deb12u1                                                           |\n| Fixed version  | 72.1-3+deb12u1                                                            |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<72.1-3+deb12u1",
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "fixed_version": "72.1-3+deb12u1",
