            {
              "id": "CVE-2025-66293",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2025-66293"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2025-66293?s=debian&n=libpng1.6&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1.6.39-2%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "LIBPNG is a reference library for use in applications that read, create, and manipulate PNG (Portable Network Graphics) raster image files. Prior to 1.6.52, an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in libpng's simplified API allows reading up to 1012 bytes beyond the png_sRGB_base[512] array when processing valid palette PNG images with partial transparency and gamma correction. The PNG files that trigger this vulnerability are valid per the PNG specification; the bug is in libpng's internal state management. Upgrade to libpng 1.6.52 or later.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.52-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1121877)\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/security/advisories/GHSA-9mpm-9pxh-mg4f\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/788a624d7387a758ffd5c7ab010f1870dea753a1 (v1.6.52)\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/a05a48b756de63e3234ea6b3b938b8f5f862484a (v1.6.52)\n",
                "markdown": "> LIBPNG is a reference library for use in applications that read, create, and manipulate PNG (Portable Network Graphics) raster image files. Prior to 1.6.52, an out-of-bounds read vulnerability in libpng's simplified API allows reading up to 1012 bytes beyond the png_sRGB_base[512] array when processing valid palette PNG images with partial transparency and gamma correction. The PNG files that trigger this vulnerability are valid per the PNG specification; the bug is in libpng's internal state management. Upgrade to libpng 1.6.52 or later.\n\n---\n- libpng1.6 1.6.52-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1121877)\nhttps://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/security/advisories/GHSA-9mpm-9pxh-mg4f\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/788a624d7387a758ffd5c7ab010f1870dea753a1 (v1.6.52)\nFixed by: https://github.com/pnggroup/libpng/commit/a05a48b756de63e3234ea6b3b938b8f5f862484a (v1.6.52)\n\n|                |                                                                                   |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libpng1.6@1.6.39-2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1.6.39-2+deb12u1                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 1.6.39-2+deb12u1                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.6.39-2+deb12u1",
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "fixed_version": "1.6.39-2+deb12u1",
                "purls": [
