            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-48029",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-48029"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-48029?s=debian&n=libheif&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "libheif is a HEIF and AVIF file format decoder and encoder. Versions 1.19.0 through 1.21.2 have a heap OOB read in ImageItem_Grid::decode_grid_tile via irot-induced tile-coordinate underflow. Version 1.22.0 fixes the issue.\n\n---\n- libheif 1.23.1-1\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/security/advisories/GHSA-6x5f-qchq-cxqv\n",
                "markdown": "> libheif is a HEIF and AVIF file format decoder and encoder. Versions 1.19.0 through 1.21.2 have a heap OOB read in ImageItem_Grid::decode_grid_tile via irot-induced tile-coordinate underflow. Version 1.22.0 fixes the issue.\n\n---\n- libheif 1.23.1-1\nhttps://github.com/strukturag/libheif/security/advisories/GHSA-6x5f-qchq-cxqv\n\n|                |                                                                                           |\n|----------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libheif@1.15.1-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                        |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                                 |\n"
