            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-6471",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-6471"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-6471?s=debian&n=postgresql-15&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C15.19-0%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Missing authorization in PostgreSQL logical decoding allows a non-superuser holding REPLICATION privilege to dlopen any file visible to the operating system account running the server, via the choice of logical decoding plugin.  This in turn runs arbitrary code as that account.  Versions before PostgreSQL 18.5, 17.11, 16.15, 15.19, and 14.24 are affected.\n\n---\n- postgresql-18 18.6-1\n- postgresql-17 <removed>\n- postgresql-15 <removed>\n- postgresql-13 <unfixed>\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2026-6471/\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/about/news/postgresql-186-1711-1615-1519-1424-and-19-beta-3-released-3365/\n",
                "markdown": "> Missing authorization in PostgreSQL logical decoding allows a non-superuser holding REPLICATION privilege to dlopen any file visible to the operating system account running the server, via the choice of logical decoding plugin.  This in turn runs arbitrary code as that account.  Versions before PostgreSQL 18.5, 17.11, 16.15, 15.19, and 14.24 are affected.\n\n---\n- postgresql-18 18.6-1\n- postgresql-17 <removed>\n- postgresql-15 <removed>\n- postgresql-13 <unfixed>\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/support/security/CVE-2026-6471/\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/about/news/postgresql-186-1711-1615-1519-1424-and-19-beta-3-released-3365/\n\n|                |                                                                                                |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/postgresql-15@15.10-0%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <15.19-0+deb12u1                                                                               |\n| Fixed version  | 15.19-0+deb12u1                                                                                |\n"
              },
