            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-50593",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-50593"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-50593?s=debian&n=graphite2&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1.3.14-1%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Graphite before 1.3.15 has an integer underflow and resultant out-of-bounds write via Graphite actions, because slotat does not ensure that an offset is within the allowed slot-map range.\n\n---\n- graphite2 1.3.15-2\n[trixie] - graphite2 1.3.14-2+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - graphite2 1.3.14-1+deb12u1\n[bullseye] - graphite2 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nFixed by: https://github.com/silnrsi/graphite/commit/ad78c6b7319909e1540c1b134e115ced03417866 (1.3.15)\n",
                "markdown": "> Graphite before 1.3.15 has an integer underflow and resultant out-of-bounds write via Graphite actions, because slotat does not ensure that an offset is within the allowed slot-map range.\n\n---\n- graphite2 1.3.15-2\n[trixie] - graphite2 1.3.14-2+deb13u1\n[bookworm] - graphite2 1.3.14-1+deb12u1\n[bullseye] - graphite2 <postponed> (Minor issue)\nFixed by: https://github.com/silnrsi/graphite/commit/ad78c6b7319909e1540c1b134e115ced03417866 (1.3.15)\n\n|                |                                                                                   |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/graphite2@1.3.14-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1.3.14-1+deb12u1                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 1.3.14-1+deb12u1                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.3.14-1+deb12u1",
