            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-33908",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-33908"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-33908?s=debian&n=imagemagick&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u9",
              "help": {
                "text": "ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. In versions below both 7.1.2-19 and 6.9.13-44, Magick frees the memory of the XML tree via the `DestroyXMLTree()` function; however, this process is executed recursively with no depth limit imposed. When Magick processes an XML file with deeply nested structures, it will exhaust the stack memory, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS) attack. This issue has been fixed in versions 6.9.13-44 and 7.1.2-19.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.19+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-fwvm-ggf6-2p4x\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ccdc01180276aa2cb3d4a32a611aa4f417061cd8 (7.1.2-19)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/4a8819a0e1c2768d592cb6e8584cadecf9cf536e (6.9.13-44)\n",
                "markdown": "> ImageMagick is free and open-source software used for editing and manipulating digital images. In versions below both 7.1.2-19 and 6.9.13-44, Magick frees the memory of the XML tree via the `DestroyXMLTree()` function; however, this process is executed recursively with no depth limit imposed. When Magick processes an XML file with deeply nested structures, it will exhaust the stack memory, resulting in a Denial of Service (DoS) attack. This issue has been fixed in versions 6.9.13-44 and 7.1.2-19.\n\n---\n- imagemagick 8:7.1.2.19+dfsg1-1\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/security/advisories/GHSA-fwvm-ggf6-2p4x\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick/commit/ccdc01180276aa2cb3d4a32a611aa4f417061cd8 (7.1.2-19)\nhttps://github.com/ImageMagick/ImageMagick6/commit/4a8819a0e1c2768d592cb6e8584cadecf9cf536e (6.9.13-44)\n\n|                |                                                                                                               |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/imagemagick@8%3A6.9.11.60%2Bdfsg-1.6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u9                                                                                 |\n| Fixed version  | 8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u9                                                                                  |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u9",
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
                "fixed_version": "8:6.9.11.60+dfsg-1.6+deb12u9",
                "purls": [
