            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-5201",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-5201"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-5201?s=debian&n=gdk-pixbuf&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C2.42.10%2Bdfsg-1%2Bdeb12u4",
              "help": {
                "text": "A flaw was found in the gdk-pixbuf library. This heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability occurs in the JPEG image loader due to improper validation of color component counts when processing a specially crafted JPEG image. A remote attacker can exploit this flaw without user interaction, for example, via thumbnail generation. Successful exploitation leads to application crashes and denial of service (DoS) conditions.\n\n---\n- gdk-pixbuf 2.44.6+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132501)\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/issues/304\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/merge_requests/266\nFixed by: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/commit/6cce9311e70b969cbcc6e3e1e74ae1756ed02d5b (2.44.6)\n",
                "markdown": "> A flaw was found in the gdk-pixbuf library. This heap-based buffer overflow vulnerability occurs in the JPEG image loader due to improper validation of color component counts when processing a specially crafted JPEG image. A remote attacker can exploit this flaw without user interaction, for example, via thumbnail generation. Successful exploitation leads to application crashes and denial of service (DoS) conditions.\n\n---\n- gdk-pixbuf 2.44.6+dfsg-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1132501)\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/issues/304\nhttps://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/merge_requests/266\nFixed by: https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gdk-pixbuf/-/commit/6cce9311e70b969cbcc6e3e1e74ae1756ed02d5b (2.44.6)\n\n|                |                                                                                                      |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/gdk-pixbuf@2.42.10%2Bdfsg-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <2.42.10+dfsg-1+deb12u4                                                                              |\n| Fixed version  | 2.42.10+dfsg-1+deb12u4                                                                               |\n"
