            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-6479",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-6479"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-6479?s=debian&n=postgresql-15&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C15.18-0%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Uncontrolled recursion in PostgreSQL SSL and GSS negotiation allows an attacker able to connect to a PostgreSQL AF_UNIX socket to achieve sustained denial of service.  If SSL and GSS are both disabled, an attacker can do the same via access to a PostgreSQL TCP socket.  Versions before PostgreSQL 18.4, 17.10, 16.14, 15.18, and 14.23 are affected.\n\n---\n- postgresql-18 18.4-1\n- postgresql-17 <removed>\n- postgresql-15 <removed>\n- postgresql-13 <removed>\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/about/news/postgresql-184-1710-1614-1518-and-1423-released-3297/\n",
                "markdown": "> Uncontrolled recursion in PostgreSQL SSL and GSS negotiation allows an attacker able to connect to a PostgreSQL AF_UNIX socket to achieve sustained denial of service.  If SSL and GSS are both disabled, an attacker can do the same via access to a PostgreSQL TCP socket.  Versions before PostgreSQL 18.4, 17.10, 16.14, 15.18, and 14.23 are affected.\n\n---\n- postgresql-18 18.4-1\n- postgresql-17 <removed>\n- postgresql-15 <removed>\n- postgresql-13 <removed>\nhttps://www.postgresql.org/about/news/postgresql-184-1710-1614-1518-and-1423-released-3297/\n\n|                |                                                                                                |\n|----------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/postgresql-15@15.10-0%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <15.18-0+deb12u1                                                                               |\n| Fixed version  | 15.18-0+deb12u1                                                                                |\n"
              },
