            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-9496",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-9496: Inefficient Regular Expression Complexity"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-9496?s=github&n=pacote&t=npm&vr=%3E%3D11.2.7%2C%3C21.5.1",
              "help": {
                "text": "Versions of the package pacote from 11.2.7 are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) via the addGitSha function. An attacker can exploit this vulnerability by supplying a specially crafted spec.rawSpec value that triggers the function’s regex replacement and string-manipulation logic, causing excessive CPU consumption and potentially stalling or crashing the process.\n",
                "markdown": "> Versions of the package pacote from 11.2.7 are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) via the addGitSha function. An attacker can exploit this vulnerability by supplying a specially crafted spec.rawSpec value that triggers the function’s regex replacement and string-manipulation logic, causing excessive CPU consumption and potentially stalling or crashing the process.\n\n|                |                                                                     |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:npm/pacote@20.0.0                                               |\n| Affected range | >=11.2.7,<21.5.1                                                    |\n| Fixed version  | 21.5.1                                                              |\n| CVSS Score     |                                                                 7.7 |\n| CVSS Vector    | CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:P |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">=11.2.7,<21.5.1",
