            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-63384",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-63384"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-63384?s=debian&n=libevent&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Libevent is an event notification library. Prior to 2.1.13 and 2.2.2-alpha, libevent has an incorrect integer conversion in event_tagging.c when evtag_unmarshal_header uses evtag_decode_int to decode an attacker-controlled uint32 payload length and returns it as a signed int. Values above INT_MAX become negative or truncated, and evtag_unmarshal_string can use the converted value in allocation sizing, producing a wrapped large allocation request and denial of service. This issue is fixed in versions 2.1.13 and 2.2.2-alpha.\n\n---\n- libevent 2.1.13-stable-1\nhttps://github.com/libevent/libevent/security/advisories/GHSA-45c6-qx49-89m8\nFixed by: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/commit/5e3c6ebe342b34c5a9bcf48e9a32ad6708b9c416 (release-2.1.13-stable)\nFixed by: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/commit/109c16499282959d70f56ec3baf4c8b1e6646bda (release-2.2.2-alpha)\n",
                "markdown": "> Libevent is an event notification library. Prior to 2.1.13 and 2.2.2-alpha, libevent has an incorrect integer conversion in event_tagging.c when evtag_unmarshal_header uses evtag_decode_int to decode an attacker-controlled uint32 payload length and returns it as a signed int. Values above INT_MAX become negative or truncated, and evtag_unmarshal_string can use the converted value in allocation sizing, producing a wrapped large allocation request and denial of service. This issue is fixed in versions 2.1.13 and 2.2.2-alpha.\n\n---\n- libevent 2.1.13-stable-1\nhttps://github.com/libevent/libevent/security/advisories/GHSA-45c6-qx49-89m8\nFixed by: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/commit/5e3c6ebe342b34c5a9bcf48e9a32ad6708b9c416 (release-2.1.13-stable)\nFixed by: https://github.com/libevent/libevent/commit/109c16499282959d70f56ec3baf4c8b1e6646bda (release-2.2.2-alpha)\n\n|                |                                                                                         |\n|----------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/libevent@2.1.12-stable-8?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                      |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                               |\n"
              },
