            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-66046",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-66046"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-66046?s=debian&n=expat&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3E0",
              "help": {
                "text": "Expat through 2.8.3 contains a denial of service vulnerability caused by quadratic algorithmic complexity in the storeAtts() function in xmlparse.c, where processing N specified attributes with non-normalized values triggers an O(N^2) linear scan of elementType->defaultAtts to determine CDATA status. A remote unauthenticated attacker can supply a single well-formed XML document of a few megabytes to an application parsing untrusted XML to cause excessive CPU consumption, resulting in denial of service without requiring authentication, external entity resolution, or non-default parser options.\n\n---\n- expat <unfixed> (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1144925)\n[trixie] - expat <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/1321\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/98f5acc146af76859cd7c345c0906e9e9e8ea656\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/f8f7c4ffd883e3c2c58f0ebb49416a6c1d248738\nRequires followup to not open CVE-2026-76641:\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/98599f6dcc2b460410881fe420f5f55d6bec63bf\n",
                "markdown": "> Expat through 2.8.3 contains a denial of service vulnerability caused by quadratic algorithmic complexity in the storeAtts() function in xmlparse.c, where processing N specified attributes with non-normalized values triggers an O(N^2) linear scan of elementType->defaultAtts to determine CDATA status. A remote unauthenticated attacker can supply a single well-formed XML document of a few megabytes to an application parsing untrusted XML to cause excessive CPU consumption, resulting in denial of service without requiring authentication, external entity resolution, or non-default parser options.\n\n---\n- expat <unfixed> (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1144925)\n[trixie] - expat <no-dsa> (Minor issue)\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/pull/1321\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/98f5acc146af76859cd7c345c0906e9e9e8ea656\nFixed by: https://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/f8f7c4ffd883e3c2c58f0ebb49416a6c1d248738\nRequires followup to not open CVE-2026-76641:\nhttps://github.com/libexpat/libexpat/commit/98599f6dcc2b460410881fe420f5f55d6bec63bf\n\n|                |                                                                                        |\n|----------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/expat@2.5.0-1%2Bdeb12u1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                     |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                              |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": ">0",
                "cvssV3_severity": "HIGH",
