            {
              "id": "CVE-2026-32327",
              "name": "OsPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "CVE-2026-32327"
              },
              "helpUri": "https://scout.docker.com/v/CVE-2026-32327?s=debian&n=apr-util&ns=debian&t=deb&osn=debian&osv=12&vr=%3C1.6.3-1%2Bdeb12u1",
              "help": {
                "text": "A bug in APR-util version 1.6.3 (and earlier) allows a stack recursion attack against any library consumer which parses XML from untrusted sources and uses the apr_xml_quote_elem() function.  Users are recommended to upgrade to version 1.6.4, which fixes this issue.\n\n---\n- apr-util 1.6.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1143837)\nhttps://lists.apache.org/thread/hq27vj8yfno9tkwv0fpj6jksfzgxvth1\nFixed by: https://github.com/apache/apr-util/commit/414e12e427c89f135d8ee66ab1203feffd3e2bd8 (1.6.4-rc1-candidate)\n",
                "markdown": "> A bug in APR-util version 1.6.3 (and earlier) allows a stack recursion attack against any library consumer which parses XML from untrusted sources and uses the apr_xml_quote_elem() function.  Users are recommended to upgrade to version 1.6.4, which fixes this issue.\n\n---\n- apr-util 1.6.4-1 (bug https://bugs.debian.org/cgi-bin/bugreport.cgi?bug=1143837)\nhttps://lists.apache.org/thread/hq27vj8yfno9tkwv0fpj6jksfzgxvth1\nFixed by: https://github.com/apache/apr-util/commit/414e12e427c89f135d8ee66ab1203feffd3e2bd8 (1.6.4-rc1-candidate)\n\n|                |                                                                                 |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/apr-util@1.6.3-1?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | <1.6.3-1+deb12u1                                                                |\n| Fixed version  | 1.6.3-1+deb12u1                                                                 |\n"
              },
              "properties": {
                "affected_version": "<1.6.3-1+deb12u1",
