              "help": {
                "text": "An issue in libtiff 85f2ac8e0b01cb7db2bbecf4a3b891bdbef67938 allows an attacker to execute arbitrary code via the process_command_opts() function in tools/tiffcrop.c\n\n---\n- tiff 4.7.2-1\nhttps://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/work_items/846\nFixed by: https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/commit/b04e935cb6242f22cc8b63c99a372cf3ea825e4e (v4.7.2rc2)\n",
                "markdown": "> An issue in libtiff 85f2ac8e0b01cb7db2bbecf4a3b891bdbef67938 allows an attacker to execute arbitrary code via the process_command_opts() function in tools/tiffcrop.c\n\n---\n- tiff 4.7.2-1\nhttps://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/work_items/846\nFixed by: https://gitlab.com/libtiff/libtiff/-/commit/b04e935cb6242f22cc8b63c99a372cf3ea825e4e (v4.7.2rc2)\n\n|                |                                                                                       |\n|----------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| Package        | pkg:deb/debian/tiff@4.5.0-6%2Bdeb12u2?os_distro=bookworm&os_name=debian&os_version=12 |\n| Affected range | >0                                                                                    |\n| Fixed version  | not fixed                                                                             |\n"
